        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">HUT</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A building of basic construction, usually smaller in size than a house and constructed from a variety of materials such as mud, turf, branches, wood, brick, concrete or metal. Use more specific type where known.</skos:scopeNote>
