        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">MARITIME</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Sites, building, structures &amp; features associated with the construction, maintenance &amp; supply of maritime craft. Includes associated ancillary structures such as navigation aids, dockyards, wharves, etc; does not include vessels.</skos:scopeNote>
