    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CREMATION PIT</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A pit over which a  corpse has been cremated on a pyre into which the remains and debris, and sometime grave goods, collapse and are buried. Generally confined to the Roman period.</skos:scopeNote>
