    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">FLOOD RELIEF CANAL</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A channel dug, or built up, to carry away surplus water from a river or waterway to prevent it bursting its banks and flooding.</skos:scopeNote>
