        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">AUXILIARY UNIT SPECIAL DUTIES BASE</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A well concealed structure, usually constructed undergound, intended for use by members of the Special Duties section of the Auxiliary Units (or British Resistance Organization) in the event of invasion.</skos:scopeNote>
