    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">BRENNAN TORPEDO STATION</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A land based installation armed with wire -guided and powered  Brennan torpedoes which were in operation beween 1890 and 1906. These torpedoes were invented by Louis Philip Brennan. The stations were used to defend the coast from enemy shipping.""</skos:scopeNote>
