    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">DARLAND FIELD SYSTEM</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Medieval Fenland ditched field system where the land is divided into strips for agricultural production. The strips are separated by hand-dug wide shallow drainage ditches with the spoil thrown up to create a dryer ridge.</skos:scopeNote>
