    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">GENERAL BAPTIST CHAPEL</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A place of worship for General Baptists, a movement established by John Smyth in 1603 and which grew out of the original Baptist church. They believed in free will and are often referred to simply as Baptists.</skos:scopeNote>
