    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">REEL DRYING STOVE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A structure or building used in the manufacture of the explosive cordite. After the cordite had been pressed to extract moisture it was placed on racks within the stove prior to being taken to the reeling house for winding.</skos:scopeNote>
