    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ROADSIDE LIGHTHOUSE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A lighted pillar or LIGHTHOUSE, eg. Dunston Pillar, Lincs., erected in 1751 to guide travellers over the heath.</skos:scopeNote>
