    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CROW</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A multipurpose hut constructed from stone and turf, covering a square or polygonal plan. It has drystone walls and a slightly corbelled roof, usually topped with slabs. Can be either free-standing or embedded in a Cornish hedge. Particular to Cornwall.</skos:scopeNote>
