    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">LAMSON PNEUMATIC TUBE SYSTEM</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A communication system in which cylindrical containers are propelled through a network of tubes either by compressed air or partial vacuum. They are used for transporting solid objects, as opposed to conventional pipelines, which transport fluids.</skos:scopeNote>
