    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">FIRE PIT</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A pit dug into the ground or a simple construction made of stone, brick or metal. Designed to contain a fire and prevent it from spreading, but can also be used to heat stone for breaking.</skos:scopeNote>
