    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CAIRN CIRCLE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A circle of spaced upright boulders emerging from a low, hemispherical, stony mound. The boulders may lean outwards due to pressure from the cairn material.</skos:scopeNote>
