    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CABLEWAY</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">An aerial lift in which cabins are suspended from a continuous cable between two towers which hold the winding mechanism. The cable may be supported by towers or pylons.</skos:scopeNote>
