    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ANNEXE ENCLOSURE</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A subsidiary enclosure externally attached to an enclosure of known or unknown date and function. The annexe is generally smaller than, and secondary to, the main enclosure. Use more specific site type where known. Do not use for Roman military sites.</skos:scopeNote>
