    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">HOIST TOWER</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A tall stone or brick building or iron structure used to lift iron ore and coke to the top of iron works blast furnace, which are loaded from the top.</skos:scopeNote>
