    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">GRAFFITI</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Casual scribbles or pictographs on ancient walls, stones or other surfaces. In more recent times applied to humourous, satiric or obscene writings or drawings executed anonymously in public places.</skos:scopeNote>
