    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CELTIC FIELD SYSTEM</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A fairly regular system of small rectangular fields. Examples may date from the middle Bronze Age to the Roman period. The word 'Celtic' carries no chronological or cultural connotations in this context.</skos:scopeNote>
