        <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CLEARANCE CAIRN</skos:prefLabel>
        <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">An irregularly constructed, generally unstructured, mound of stones. Often, but not necessarily, circular. Normally a by product of field clearance for agricultural purposes.</skos:scopeNote>
