    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">ROMNEY HUT</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A prefabricated structure of a steel frame clad in corrugated iron. Semi-circular in section they were used for storage and as workshops, cinemas etc during WWII. Designed at Romney House, London by the Directorate of Fortifications &amp; Works.</skos:scopeNote>
