    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">COACH WORKS</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">Traditionally a building or site where stage coaches were built. Nowadays the term is applied to buildings used for the manufacturing of the body work and furnishings of motor vehicles and railway carriages.</skos:scopeNote>
