    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">CHARNEL PIT</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:scopeNote xml:lang="en">A pit used for the re-burial of disarticulated human remains from many individuals, occasionally displaying sorting of remains, eg. grouping of skulls or long bones. Distinct from mass burials which contain articulated skeletal remains.</skos:scopeNote>
